{
  "bodyHash": "d8HybF5IkjI=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>水產養殖 2 <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><em>(1.14.4+)</em></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><em>僅支援 NeoForge（1.20.4 之前僅支援 Minecraft Forge）</em></span></p><p>水產養殖 2 擴展了 Minecraft 中的釣魚系統，新增超過 30 種魚類，可以使用釣竿（任何模組或原版釣竿皆可！）捕獲，或在野外發現它們在水中游動<span style=\"font-size:10px\">。</span>&nbsp;它還新增了一系列新釣竿，讓你能裝備鉤子與魚餌以獲得額外功能。另有自訂釣魚線與浮標，讓你的釣竿獨一無二。修飾與自訂物品可在工具箱中應用，該工具箱也可用來存放額外的鉤子、魚餌、釣線與浮標。<br>\n每種生態系類型——甚至是模組生態系——都有新的魚種，能豐富你的釣魚體驗與世界，魚類生物會在河流、池塘和海洋中游動！捕獲的魚可以製成魚片，魚片的數量取決於魚的大小<span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;<em>（若啟用設定選項，則依重量而定）。</em></span>&nbsp;此外，釣魚時還有機會獲得閃閃發光的新戰利品！（包括傳說中的海神工具或盔甲！&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;<em>（可設定））</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>更多文件可在我們的維基中找到。</em></a></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p><h3>可捕獲魚類</h3><p>**淡水<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/smallmouth_bass.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;小口黑鱸<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/bluegill.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;藍鰓太陽魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/brown_trout.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;褐鱒<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/carp.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;鯉魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/catfish.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;鯰魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/gar.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;雀鱔<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/minnow.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;米諾魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/muskellunge.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;北美狗魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/perch.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;河鱸</p><p>**乾旱<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/bayad.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;巴亞德鯰<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/boulti.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;布爾蒂（尼羅羅非魚）<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/capitaine.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;卡皮塔內（尼羅河鱸）<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/synodontis.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;辛諾多提斯</p><p><strong>北極海洋</strong><br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/atlantic_cod.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;大西洋鱈魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/blackfish.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;黑魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/pacific_halibut.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;太平洋大比目魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/atlantic_halibut.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;大西洋大比目魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/atlantic_herring.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;大西洋鯡魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/pink_salmon.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;粉紅鮭 <span style=\"font-size:10px\"><em>（也可在河流抓到）<br></em></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/pollock.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;綠青鱈<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/rainbow_trout.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;虹鱒<br></span></p><p>**鹹水<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/jellyfish.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;水母<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/red_grouper.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;紅石斑魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/tuna.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;鮪魚</p><p>**叢林<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/arapaima.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;巨骨舌魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/arrau_turtle.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;阿拉烏龜<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/piranha.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;食人魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/tambaqui.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;坦巴奇魚</p><p>**沼澤<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/AQ2-1.18.2/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/frog.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;青蛙 <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><em>（自 Minecraft 1.19 起移除）</em></span></span><br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/leech.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;水蛭<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/box_turtle.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;箱龜<br>\n<em>&amp; 淡水魚</em></p><p><strong>蘑菇島</strong><br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/red_shrooma.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;紅蘑菇魚<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/brown_shrooma.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;棕蘑菇魚<br>\n<em>&amp; 淡水魚</em></p><p>**其他戰利品<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/driftwood.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;漂流木<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/tin_can.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;錫罐<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/goldfish.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;金魚<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/message_in_a_bottle.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;瓶中信 [按右鍵顯示訊息！] <br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/algae.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;藻類（淡水生態系）<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/box.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;盒子<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/lockbox.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;鎖箱<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/treasure_chest.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;寶藏箱<br></span>\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_5b8066e6-2213-4384-bd51-f1a9ebc43885.png\" alt=\"image\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;海神的賞賜</span></p><h2><strong>配方</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_7cd9898d-34ac-41cf-bc0a-83f164936de2.png\" alt=\"image\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_f4cea8f5-8a94-4faf-ac50-545b226ca22a.png\" alt=\"image\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_6bc91821-7595-4bd9-ad44-d74559bb46e4.png\" alt=\"image\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_ae62d924-8a4d-4e23-8b04-31f06095fde7.png\" alt=\"image\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_b8273603-600f-4de3-bc49-1668e832b3f8.png\" alt=\"image\"></p><h2>**截圖</h2><p>**</p><h2><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WcjgaH5.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h2><h2><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_010ee9bb-373a-4eae-95d2-dfc006a5ac32.png\" alt=\"image\"></strong></h2><h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Pee4rVN.png\" alt=\"\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>水產養殖 1&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:8px\">(1.12.2 及之前版本)</span></strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><h2><strong>水產養殖</strong></h2><h2><strong>介紹</strong></h2><p>水產養殖是 Minecraft 基礎釣魚系統的擴展。它讓你能夠使用全新的釣竿和工具系列，捕獲超過 30 種新魚類。每個生態域都有不同種類的新魚，具有隨機重量，可以製成魚片和食物，此外，釣魚時還能獲得閃亮的新戰利品！（包括傳說中的海神工具或盔甲！）<br>&nbsp;</p><p>要開始你的水產養殖之旅，你需要先製作一把鐵、金或鑽石釣竿（見下方）。</p><h2><strong>可捕魚類</strong></h2><p><strong>淡水</strong>（森林、平原、丘陵）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vy8Fg.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/vy8Fg.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 藍腮太陽魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hfmXq.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/hfmXq.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鱸魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fBPF4.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/fBPF4.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 河鱸<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hf9TK.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/hf9TK.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 褐鱒<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/STo9U.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/STo9U.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鯰魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hi3x8.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hi3x8.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鯉魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/olH26.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/olH26.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 北美狗魚</p><p><strong>乾燥</strong>（沙漠）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lDQoL0K.png\">&nbsp;尼羅河尖吻鱸<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I26Avrc.png\">&nbsp;尼羅羅非魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/R5QHHFq.png\">&nbsp;鱨魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dgwY14b.png\">&nbsp;歧鬚鮠</p><p><strong>極地</strong>（苔原、針葉林）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4GcZL.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/4GcZL.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鱈魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9s2ltlX.png\">&nbsp;青鱈<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qVDga8e.png\">&nbsp;鯡魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mrSz9ij.png\">&nbsp;大比目魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sCzdERo.png\">&nbsp;粉紅鮭<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjDhV.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjDhV.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 虹鱒<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AV269o8.png\" width=\"17\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;黑魚</p><p><strong>鹹水</strong>（沙灘、海洋）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BXImf.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/BXImf.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鮭魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eFpIp.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/eFpIp.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鮪魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rVr2e.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/rVr2e.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 紅石斑<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jw13H.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jw13H.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 劍魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p489Z.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/p489Z.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鯊魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v9G69.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/v9G69.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鯨魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VoalDkJ.png\">&nbsp;魷魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QBYqKg0.png\">&nbsp;河豚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/O7O4Yhn.png\">&nbsp;水母</p><p><strong>熱帶</strong>（叢林）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VxAbR5Z.png\">&nbsp;巨骨舌魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZJfauHY.png\">&nbsp;食人魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZBq8t3r.png\">&nbsp;大頭魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1W9PXAS.png\"> 電鰻</p><p><strong>半鹹水</strong>（沼澤）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g0poZkE.png\">&nbsp;青蛙<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lBdrN6N.png\">&nbsp;烏龜<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tyWN6yW.png\">&nbsp;水蛭<br><em>以及淡水性魚類</em></p><p><strong>蘑菇</strong>（蘑菇島）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AJKDC.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/AJKDC.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 紅蘑菇魚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/udpV8.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/udpV8.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 棕蘑菇魚<br><em>以及淡水性魚類</em></p><p><strong>所有生態域<br></strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aCuEOwi.png\">&nbsp;金魚</p><p><strong>隨機戰利品<br></strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/b4g5G3X.png\">&nbsp;藻類（淡水生態域）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mXcrvNX.png\">&nbsp;海草（鹹水生態域）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/k55j8Ce.png\">&nbsp;木棍<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/muk8uoO.png\">漂流木 [可合成為木材！]<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vHoSvD1.png\">&nbsp;皮革靴子<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EFfLBqW.png\">&nbsp;錫罐<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8upC4TT.png\">&nbsp;骨頭<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S2meWvo.png\">&nbsp;瓶中信 [右鍵點擊可顯示訊息！]<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/czINLcQ.png\">&nbsp;盒子<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XdbpBOV.png\">&nbsp;鎖盒<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5Rhw4Kb.png\">&nbsp;寶藏箱<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qp9VJRT.png\">&nbsp;海神箱（？！？）<br><br></p><p>注意：如果你使用新增生態域的模組，或正在釣魚的生態域沒有特定魚類，則預設會捕捉淡水性魚類。</p><h2><strong>合成配方</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rD02ZQ8.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/d1CPhaD.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/so1cDZT.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uNoAFwR.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a1PqJ01.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LmSyklA.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HSw5Nk9.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dRYEhhO.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wXoxO0H.png\" width=\"456\" height=\"256\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tlqIbKH.png\"></p><h2><strong>附魔</strong></h2><p>誘餌 - 捕獲更多魚<br>磁性 - 捕獲更多戰利品<br>遠投 - 釣竿拋得更遠<br>近投 - 釣竿拋得更近<br>雙鉤 - 有機會一次釣到兩條魚<br>倒刺鉤 - 收竿時間更長<br>重線 - 有更高機會釣到更重的魚</p><h2><strong>截圖</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hm36i.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hm36i.png\" width=\"864\" height=\"514\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IBksh.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/IBksh.png\" width=\"872\" height=\"520\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a7shC.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/a7shC.png\" width=\"864\" height=\"504\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wj8ro.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/wj8ro.png\" width=\"892\" height=\"544\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qETDITO.png\"></p></div><h4><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a><br></strong></span><a href=\"https://github.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">https://github.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture</span></a></h4><h4>請在我們的 GitHub 上回報任何錯誤！在 CurseForge 留言中回報的問題將會被刪除。</h4><h2><strong>媒體：</strong></h2><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLFq6KXy6_gov6zQzCcFa_VirNZcZLtcVP\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_5008d271-0bdf-4782-a5bf-ba3d9e01796f.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscordapp.com%252finvite%252fTuJXw7V\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_88d2c935-c2f7-42a6-9a7f-9fb3d1e4957c.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h2><strong>使用權限</strong></h2><p><strong>使用者無需徵求許可即可進行以下操作。</strong><br>\n- 你<strong>可以</strong>製作影片或截圖並發布到任何地方，只需註明此模組名稱並告知他人何處獲取即可。<br>\n- 你<strong>可以</strong>將其加入模組包，前提是模組包需標明出處並連結回此頁面。</p><p><strong>使用者不得對本模組進行以下操作。</strong><br>\n- 未經許可，你<strong>不得</strong>重新分發或上傳此模組！<br>\n- 你<strong>不得</strong>反編譯程式碼或將美術資源用於其他模組，特殊情況可申請授權！</p>",
